              "asynchronous_ai_overview": true,
              "markdown": "![How to Prevent Crow&#39;s Feet - The Dermatology Specialists](https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/10090948-1509-0139-0000-bf8198f9de34:4)\nCrow’s feet are `fine lines and wrinkles that radiate from the outer corners of the eyes`.[[1]](https://www.adsum-aesthetics.co.uk/conditions/crows-feet/)\n\n### Causes\n\n- **Natural Aging:** Collagen and elastin production drops by roughly 1% each year starting around age 25.[[1]](https://www.vizage.co.uk/post/crow-s-feet-the-expert-guide-to-eye-rejuvenation-in-london)\n- **Thin Skin:** The skin around the eyes is 40% thinner and has fewer oil glands than the rest of the face.[[1]](https://www.germainedecapuccini.com/uk_en/blog/posts/crows-feet-face)[[2]](https://www.vizage.co.uk/post/crow-s-feet-the-expert-guide-to-eye-rejuvenation-in-london)\n- **Repeated Expressions:** Smiling, laughing, and squinting contract the *orbicularis oculi* muscle, turning temporary lines into permanent ones over time.[[1]](https://www.kiehls.com/skincare-advice/how-to-treat-crows-feet.html)[[2]](https://www.adsum-aesthetics.co.uk/conditions/crows-feet/)\n- **Environmental Factors:** Ultraviolet (UV) sun exposure, smoking, and pollution accelerate collagen breakdown.[[1]](https://www.germainedecapuccini.com/uk_en/blog/posts/crows-feet-face)\n\n### Prevention and At-Home Care\n\n- **Sun Protection:** Wear broad-spectrum SPF sunscreen and sunglasses daily to block UV-induced collagen damage.[[1]](https://www.today.com/shop/what-are-crows-feet-rcna194576)[[2]](https://perfectskinstudio.co.uk/blog/best-treatment-for-crows-feet/)\n- **Topical Skincare:** Use retinoids or retinol to stimulate cell turnover and collagen, hyaluronic acid for hydration, and antioxidants like Vitamin C.[[1]](https://perfectskinstudio.co.uk/blog/best-treatment-for-crows-feet/)[[2]](https://www.today.com/shop/what-are-crows-feet-rcna194576)\n\n### In-Office Treatments\n\n- **Botulinum Toxin (Botox, Dysport):** Relaxes the muscle contractions that cause dynamic expression lines (typically lasting 3 to 6 months).[[1]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RnQdgcLU4Hc&t=20)[[2]](https://www.vizage.co.uk/anti-wrinkle-treatments/crows-feet)\n- **Dermal Fillers:** Hyaluronic acid fillers plump deeper static creases.[[1]](https://www.infinityclinic.co.uk/concerns/face-concerns/crows-feet/)[[2]](https://perfectskinstudio.co.uk/blog/best-treatment-for-crows-feet/)\n- **Resurfacing & Energy Devices:** Microneedling, radiofrequency (such as Morpheus8), chemical peels, and laser resurfacing rebuild skin structure.[[1]](https://www.infinityclinic.co.uk/concerns/face-concerns/crows-feet/)[[2]](https://perfectskinstudio.co.uk/blog/best-treatment-for-crows-feet/)\n\nIf you'd like, let me know:\n\n- Are you looking for **over-the-counter product recommendations**?\n- Are you curious about **in-office procedures and costs**?",
